{"w":2400,"h":3172,"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.09980806039384281,"y":0.047919293871711233,"w":0.31094050089518227,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","h":0.01607818411097095},{"w":0.34965922037760416,"h":0.023937891590940952,"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 1","x":0.099667124106534569,"c":1,"y":0.094410846604501497},{"h":0.014586205139737407,"w":0.18426104227701823,"c":1,"t":"MODEL ANSWER","y":0.13366960899654801,"x":0.099808058361765095},{"y":0.17150063070997634,"h":0.017452857533439281,"x":0.099808053433883687,"w":0.79270634969075515,"t":"This model has been prepared by an examiner as an example of a very good answer.","c":1},{"x":0.099808054438121865,"h":0.018924675252368517,"c":1,"y":0.19040697672777962,"t":"However, please note that this is just one example out of many possible approaches.","w":0.78119003295898437},{"c":1,"h":0.018968664532501456,"x":0.1094049910810304,"y":0.22667087036271716,"t":"Grange Park was opened in 1920, a rectangular area with access from Arnold Avenue","w":0.79078694661458337},{"h":0.017495014628425842,"c":1,"y":0.24558638059232574,"w":0.79078694661458326,"x":0.10940499108981991,"t":"on the north side and from Eldon Street on the south side. There was a fountain in the"},{"h":0.02020381528221793,"w":0.78320821126302087,"t":"centre, with a stage for musicians situated centre left, a glasshouse to the right of the","x":0.10936011887585588,"y":0.26286831323086479,"c":1},{"t":"Eldon Street entrance and a pond for water plants in the north east corner opposite.","y":0.28184110968961262,"w":0.76967371622721348,"c":1,"x":0.11132437005583161,"h":0.017654476670870056},{"c":1,"t":"Around the edges of the park there were rose gardens, with seats nearby for people","x":0.1094050011913159,"y":0.30075662038458639,"h":0.017654476670870167,"w":0.77159306844075515},{"y":0.31690827813457323,"w":0.36699551900227867,"t":"to smell the flowers and listen to music.","h":0.020379411618015042,"c":1,"x":0.10731939608760509},{"w":0.79283243815104165,"t":"The park has altered considerably since then. Now there is one large-ish rose garden,","c":1,"y":0.35474908891390333,"x":0.10934715934161261,"h":0.019257427614844724},{"w":0.78694819132486982,"h":0.017496847414880223,"c":1,"y":0.37500000012344592,"x":0.10940498294171562,"t":"occupying the central area where the fountain stood, and with seats all around it. One"},{"y":0.39375788169844406,"t":"of the smaller rose gardens remains on the north side of the park. The bandstand","h":0.01612583896401254,"c":1,"x":0.10940497771447516,"w":0.7485604858398438},{"c":1,"w":0.76007675170898437,"h":0.017654476670870167,"t":"(stage for musicians) has also been replaced, by an amphitheatre for concerts and","x":0.10748561636521486,"y":0.41267339224913857},{"w":0.75060557047526044,"h":0.019267105064055268,"x":0.10934914905053764,"c":1,"y":0.42988975883337588,"t":"associated seating. The glasshouse has gone and in its places is a water feature;"},{"x":0.10940498585450058,"y":0.44912790709990769,"w":0.75239924112955725,"h":0.017454690921201443,"c":1,"t":"similarly, where the pond for water plants stood there is now a children's play area"},{"t":"with a café nearby. Access to the park is still via the two original entrances, but there","w":0.77555440266927078,"h":0.020675845585133912,"y":0.46651082740423488,"c":1,"x":0.10933608904998646},{"x":0.10748561212425273,"h":0.015988371561634906,"t":"is now a third entrance near the water feature from an underground car park.","y":0.48691860491466077,"w":0.71017272949218757,"c":1},{"y":0.52325581407707833,"w":0.74088292439778647,"h":0.017441860213405991,"c":1,"t":"Despite the apparently significant changes, the park retains the basic elements of","x":0.11132437263770963},{"w":0.79462570190429682,"c":1,"y":0.54066834801369512,"t":"flowers, water, seating and music, with the addition of a café and a children's play area.","h":0.018924675252368406,"x":0.10940499917947742},{"w":0.034548943837483706,"h":0.013081395460708523,"c":1,"t":"134","x":0.097888675765999036,"y":0.95348837199620817}]}